    "probe_text": "Here is the complete, ordered list of everything that happens when you `POST /api/owners`, traced from the security layer through the controller, service, repository, and entity.\n\n## Phase 0 \u2014 Before the controller body runs\n\n1. **Authorization check** \u2014 `@PreAuthorize(\"hasRole(@roles.OWNER_ADMIN)\")`. Caller must have the `OWNER_ADMIN` role, else 403.\n2. **Bean Validation of the request body** (`@Valid @RequestBody OwnerFieldsDto`, enforced by the `@Validated` generated interface). A failure throws `MethodArgumentNotValidException` \u2192 **400**. The constraints:\n   - `firstName` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Pattern(^[\\p{L}]+([ '-][\\p{L}]+){0,2}$)`, `@Size(1..30)`\n   - `lastName` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Pattern(^[\\p{L}]+([ '-][\\p{L}]+){0,2}\\.?$)`, `@Size(1..30)`\n   - `address` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..255)`\n   - `city` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..80)`\n   - `telephone` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..20)`\n   - `email` \u2014 `@Size(1..255)`, `@Email` (optional)\n   - `postcode` \u2014 `@Pattern(^[0-9]{4}$)` (optional)\n   - `registrationDate`, `birthDate` \u2014 `@Valid` (optional)\n\n## Phase 1 \u2014 Controller body (`OwnerRestControllerV1.addOwner`), in execution order\n\n3. **Normalize address** \u2014 `normalizeAddress()`: trim, collapse whitespace, upper-case, expand ST/RD/AVE.\n4. **Required-field guard** \u2014 if any of `firstName`, `lastName`, address (normalized), `city`, `telephone` is blank \u2192 `MissingOwnerFieldsException` (**400**). *(Note: this re-checks presence that Bean Validation already covers, but against the normalized address.)*\n5. **Normalize telephone** \u2014 `normalizeTelephone()` to E.164; unparseable \u2192 `InvalidTelephoneException` (**400**).\n6. **Read `sharesHousehold`** \u2014 create-time hint only, never persisted.\n7. **Map DTO \u2192 `Owner` entity** \u2014 MapStruct (`id` and `pets` ignored). Side effect: `Owner.setEmail()` **lower-cases the email**.\n8. **Store normalized address and telephone** onto the entity.\n9. **Validate email domain** \u2014 blocklist (mailinator/tempmail/guerrillamail) \u2192 `DisposableEmailDomainException` (**400**).\n10. **Validate postcode** \u2014 region range-check \u2192 `InvalidPostcodeException` (**400**).\n11. **Set `householdId`** \u2014 deterministic SHA-256-derived from last name + postcode.\n12. **Household-duplicate guard** \u2014 if *not* `sharesHousehold` and household already in use \u2192 `DuplicateIdentityException` (**409**).\n13. **Identity-key duplicate guard** \u2014 if identity key already in use \u2192 `DuplicateIdentityException` (**409**).\n14. **City-capacity guard** \u2014 if \u2265 50 owners in that city \u2192 `CityAtCapacityException` (**409**).\n15. **Future-date guard** \u2014 if `registrationDate` is after today \u2192 `FutureRegistrationDateException` (**400**).\n16. **Compute effective registration date** \u2014 default to today if absent, then `toBusinessDay()` rolls weekends forward to Monday.\n17. **Daily-limit guard** \u2014 if \u2265 100 registrations already on that business day \u2192 `DailyRegistrationLimitException` (**429**).\n18. **Set `registrationDate`** to the adjusted business day.\n19. **Set `customerCode`** \u2014 `<REGION>-<HASH8>`.\n20. **Set `namesakeCount`** \u2014 count of existing owners with same first+last name.\n21. **Set `householdSize`** \u2014 household member count after this create.\n22. **Set `possibleDuplicate` / `possibleDuplicateOf`** \u2014 soft-duplicate flagging (skipped when `sharesHousehold`).\n\n## Phase 2 \u2014 Persistence and response\n\n23. **Persist** \u2014 `clinicService.saveOwner(owner)` \u2192 `OwnerRepository.save()` (`@Transactional`). DB assigns the id; **cascades `CascadeType.ALL` to the `pets` collection** (empty on create).\n    - At flush, **Hibernate Validator re-checks entity-level constraints**: `@NotEmpty` on firstName/lastName/address/city/telephone, `@Pattern(^\\+[0-9]{8,15}$)` on telephone, `@Email` on email.\n24. **Audit log** \u2014 `AUDIT.info(\"owner created id=... customerCode=... registrationDate=... membershipLevel=...\")`.\n25. **Map to `OwnerDto`** \u2014 computes `displayName`, `initials`, `contactPreference`, `ageBand`; then sets `bulkSignupWarning` from `isBulkSignupWarning()`.\n26. **Set `Location` header** \u2192 `/api/owners/{id}`; return **201 CREATED**.\n\n## Notes on what is *not* present\n- **No** `@PrePersist`/entity lifecycle callbacks, **no** interceptors/filters, **no** published events, **no** emails, **no** async work.\n- The only custom validator in the codebase (`PetAgeValidator`) applies to pets, not owners.\n- Exception\u2192status mapping is centralized in the single `ExceptionControllerAdvice`.\n\nOne thing worth flagging: steps 12\u201314, 17, and 20\u201322 each trigger a **full `ownerRepository.findAll()` table scan** via the controller's helper methods \u2014 so a single create currently does many full-table reads before the insert.\n\n(Unrelated: the claude.ai Google Drive MCP connector needs authorization in an interactive session before its tools are usable \u2014 it played no part in this answer.)"
